  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "答题助手 · Exam helper（DSH Go 插件）",
      "text": "盯着手机屏幕，认出题目后把「第 N 题 · B」和答案原文弹成顶部通知。题库可选：放自己的 `bank.json` 就优先查表（约 1 秒），没有就走模型（约 2 秒）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin add dsh-go-exam-helper\n```\n\n或在 DSH Go 的 **插件 → 插件市场** 里点安装。装好后引擎重启会把脚本部署到 `~/.dsh/dsh-go/exam-helper`（可用 `DSH_EXAM_DIR` 改）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "用",
      "text": "1. 打开考试页面（浏览器 H5、小程序、原生 App 都行，只要是\"题 + A/B/C/D\"）\n2. 点输入框上方的 **答题助手 · 未开始**，在面板里点「开始」\n3. 切题时会弹通知：`第 7 题 · 📚 B` / `题库：35周岁`；没命中题库时是 `第 7 题 · B`"
    },
    {
      "section": "放自己的题库（可选）",
      "text": "把 `bank.json.example` 复制成 `bank.json`，按同样结构填：\n\n```json\n{ \"items\": [\n  { \"q\": \"题干文字\", \"options\": [\n      { \"letter\": \"A\", \"text\": \"选项一\" },\n      { \"letter\": \"B\", \"text\": \"选项二\" }\n\n命中题库的题会带 📚 前缀；没命中的题交给模型，答案会标 `？` 表示置信度低。"
    },
    {
      "section": "需要什么",
      "text": "- DSH Go（用手机桥接读屏）并开启 **手机操控**\n- 一个支持读图的模型（DeepSeek 账号默认即可）\n- 图形推理题正确率约 40%，会照常给答案但不保准；多选、判断也能答"
    },
    {
      "section": "隐私",
      "text": "- 截图只用于识别题目，只发给**你自己配置的模型**，不经过第三方\n- 日志只记题目摘要和答案；失败现场截图最多留 200 张，`ctl.sh clean` 可清空\n- 包里不含任何第三方题库"
    },
    {
      "section": "许可",
      "text": "MIT\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "Exam helper (DSH Go plugin)",
      "text": "Watches the phone screen and pushes the detected answer as a heads-up notification (`Q7 · B`, plus the option text). A local answer bank is optional: drop your own `bank.json` next to the runtime to answer in ~1s from the bank, otherwise it asks your model (~2s).\n\n**Install**: `dsh plugin add dsh-go-exam-helper` or use DSH Go → Plugins → Marketplace.\n\n**Use**: open the quiz page, tap the \"Exam · idle\" strip above the composer, press Start. Notifications appear as you move between questions."
    },
    {
      "section": "Exam helper (DSH Go plugin)",
      "text": "**Privacy**: screenshots are only sent to the model you configured; logs keep question summaries, not images. No third-party question bank is bundled.\n\nMIT licensed."
    }
  ],
